        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. The Association shall provide a copy of this Contract to all teachers as specified in this Contract and to each new teacher upon appointment by the Board.",
            "block_bbox": [
                33,
                151,
                489,
                206
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    33.0,
                    151.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    151.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    206.0
                ],
                [
                    33.0,
                    206.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. Individual contracts shall be issued to any teacher employed by the Board within twenty (20) duty days from the date of employment. The individual contract shall be signed by the teacher within twenty (20) duty days of its issuance and shall be returned to the Personnel Department. If any individual contract contains any language inconsistent with this Contract, this Contract shall be controlling.",
            "block_bbox": [
                34,
                205,
                489,
                313
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    34.0,
                    205.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    205.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    313.0
                ],
                [
                    34.0,
                    313.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. New teachers shall provide a health and physical fitness certificate on a form prescribed by the Board. The completed form must be submitted with fifteen (15) duty days following initial employment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                34,
                313,
                489,
                366
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    34.0,
                    313.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    313.0
                ],
                [
                    489.0,
                    366.0
                ],
                [
                    34.0,
                    366.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. Every teacher shall provide to the Personnel Department a valid Florida teaching certificate, or evidence of having qualified and applied for one within forty (40) duty days following initial employment, except as provided by Florida Statutes. The Board shall notify each new employee of this requirement upon employment. Thereafter, it shall be the responsibility of the teacher to maintain a current valid certificate or to show evidence of having qualified and applied for one as of the first scheduled duty day of each fiscal year of said teacher. The first scheduled duty day of each fiscal year for ten (10) months employees shall be the first day of pre-planning. A copy of the current valid certificate is to be on file with the Personnel Department.",
            "block_bbox": [
                35,
                366,
                492,
                581
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    35.0,
                    366.0
                ],
                [
                    492.0,
                    366.0
                ],
                [
                    492.0,
                    581.0
                ],
                [
                    35.0,
                    581.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "E. A teacher who qualifies for a certificate on the basis of non-academic preparation shall be entitled to contractual rights and privileges granted other teachers holding an equivalent certificate.",
            "block_bbox": [
                36,
                581,
                491,
                636
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    36.0,
                    581.0
                ],
                [
                    491.0,
                    581.0
                ],
                [
                    491.0,
                    636.0
                ],
